    "title": "Rechitta V2 Adds Chat Mode after 100,000 Minutes of Broker Use",
    "summary": "The Dubai proptech firm has launched a text-based chat mode alongside a rebuilt presentation experience, targeting real estate brokers handling live client queries.\nThe post Rechitta V2 Adds Chat Mode after 100,000 Minutes of Broker Use appeared first on The Fintech Times.",
    "hasSummary": true,
    "link": "https://thefintechtimes.com/rechitta-v2-adds-chat-mode-after-100000-minutes-of-broker-use/",
    "source": "The Fintech Times",
    "tags": [
      "Rechitta",
      "Dubai"
    ],
    "origin": "rss",
    "pubDate": "2026-11-13T06:00:49.000Z",
    "fetchedAt": "2026-11-13T06:01:18.621Z",
    "isDuplicateOf": null,
    "content": "Dubai-based proptech firm Rechitta has released V2 of its platform, introducing a new text-based chat mode and a rebuilt presentation experience. The update follows significant usage by real estate brokers and aims to help professionals effectively manage live client queries during property presentations and interactions.",
    "content_ta": "Dubai-யைச் சேர்ந்த proptech நிறுவனமான Rechitta, தனது platform-ன் V2 பதிப்பை வெளியிட்டுள்ளது. இது புதிய text-based chat mode மற்றும் மாற்றியமைக்கப்பட்ட presentation அனுபவத்தை அறிமுகப்படுத்துகிறது. இந்த புதிய அப்டேட் ரியல் எஸ்டேட் brokers-க்கு நேரலை client கேள்விகளை திறம்பட கையாள உதவுகிறது.",
    "slug": "rechitta-v2-adds-chat-mode-after-100-000-minutes-of-broker-use"
  },
