    "summary": "ZARU's monthly checkout value more than doubled between June and September 2026, as two rand-backed stablecoins compete for South African retail payments.\nThe post Rand Stablecoins Gain Checkout Traction on MoneyBadger Network appeared first on The Fintech Times.",
    "hasSummary": true,
